e entire month of December, earn points for open-world activities, unlock c=
hests, and earn rewards like an avatar ring, festive furniture items, and t=
he beloved *Snow Husky* mount.

As always, you can earn Challenge Points by *gathering, fishing, farming, a=
nd killing monsters*. Points count simultaneously toward a daily bonus, a w=
eekly unlockable chest, and the monthly mount and avatar ring reward. So lo=
g in, head out into the open world, gather points, and claim these rewards =
while they last!

